<section class="page-hero wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Completion notes</p><h1>The clean,<br>in plain sight.</h1><p class="lede">A short record can make follow-up simpler. This is the proposed completion-note format—not a live portal or a record of a real customer visit.</p></section><section class="section wrap split"><div><p class="eyebrow">A practical record</p><h2>Useful details.<br>No invented scores.</h2><p>Your quote should specify whether completion notes or photos are included, how they will be delivered and who may receive them.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>The agreed rooms and extras</li><li>Completed work and any limitations</li><li>Photos only with the relevant permission</li><li>A contact for questions or concerns</li></ul></div><div class="sample"><small>Illustrative only · sample record</small><h3>Move-out completion note.</h3><div class="sample-row"><span>Property</span><span>Example 2-bedroom condo</span></div><div class="sample-row"><span>Kitchen & bathrooms</span><span>Scope reviewed</span></div><div class="sample-row"><span>Appliance interiors</span><span>As agreed</span></div><div class="sample-row"><span>Photos</span><span>Only if authorised</span></div><p class="sample-note">Example note: A pre-existing mark was noted on a cabinet front. Specialist repair was outside the cleaning scope.</p></div></section><section class="soft"><div class="wrap section prose"><h2>Your home is not marketing material.</h2><p>Completion photos and permission to use an image publicly are separate decisions. We do not assume permission to publish customer spaces. Report sharing and retention need to be agreed as part of the operating process before launch.</p></div></section><div style="height:55px"></div><section class="closing wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your next step</p><h2>A clear plan for your next clean.</h2><p>Tell us about your space. We’ll review the scope, timing and cleaner availability before confirming your appointment.</p></div><a class="button light"